    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a small room you see a door, upon opening it you come to the realization that you have been kidnapped. When you come to your senses, you realize that you have to get out of this basement-like place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert! After all, the person or... creature that kidnapped you is very close and may be waiting for you around the next corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to find your way out by avoiding collisions with the kidnapper and his traps, solving riddles and passing the tests that this mysterious place has left you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is really mysterious, in search of a way out you stumble upon more and more strange things and locations...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a small room you see a door, upon opening it you come to the realization that you have been kidnapped. When you come to your senses, you realize that you have to get out of this basement-like place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert! After all, the person or... creature that kidnapped you is very close and may be waiting for you around the next corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to find your way out by avoiding collisions with the kidnapper and his traps, solving riddles and passing the tests that this mysterious place has left you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is really mysterious, in search of a way out you stumble upon more and more strange things and locations...</p>",
    "short_description": "Uncle's Basement is a survival horror game with puzzle solving elements. In it you will have to go through all the difficulties and find a way out of the place of confinement.",
